      "text": "Executor inheritance\n├─ UniProcExecutor\n│  └─ ExecutorWithExternalLauncher\n├─ MultiprocExecutor\n│  └─ RayExecutorV2\n└─ RayDistributedExecutor\n\nRayExecutorV2 ≠ old Ray executor subclass", "originalText": "Executor inheritance\n├─ UniProcExecutor\n│  └─ ExecutorWithExternalLauncher\n├─ MultiprocExecutor\n│  └─ RayExecutorV2\n└─ RayDistributedExecutor\n\nRayExecutorV2 ≠ old Ray executor subclass",
